Code from other projects
------------------------

None at present. Heartwood (GPL-3.0-or-later) and Health Disconnect
(Apache-2.0) served as references for behaviour, but no code was copied from
either. Code taken from another project in future is listed here with its
repository, file, commit and original copyright notice.

Third-party libraries
---------------------

The app is built with AndroidX (including Jetpack Compose, Navigation,
Lifecycle, DataStore and the Health Connect client), Kotlin and kotlinx
libraries, and Vico. All are licensed under the Apache License 2.0, which is
compatible with GPL-3.0-or-later. Their versions are listed in
gradle/libs.versions.toml.
